      "page": 370,
      "ruku": 319,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2999,
      "text": "Indeed, there is a sign in this, yet most of them would not believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 370,
      "ruku": 319,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3000,
      "text": "Indeed, your Lord is the All-Mighty, the Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 370,
      "ruku": 319,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3001,
      "text": "Relate to them the story of Abraham,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 370,
      "ruku": 319,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3002,
      "text": "when he said to his father and his people, “What do you worship?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 370,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3003,
      "text": "They said, “We worship idols and remain devoted to them.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 370,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3004,
      "text": "He said, “Do they hear you when you call upon them?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 370,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3005,
      "text": "Or can they benefit or harm you?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 370,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3006,
      "text": "They said, “No, but this is what we found our forefathers doing.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 370,
      "ruku": 320,
      "hizbQuarter": 148,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3007,
      "text": "He said, “Do you see what you have been worshiping,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
